[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16380.79, "timestamp": "04:33:00", "text": "意思是？我觉得我完全搞不懂“这是什么”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16392.67, "timestamp": "04:33:12", "text": "也。哦，老兄。那人浑身是汗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16397.07, "timestamp": "04:33:17", "text": "哦，不错。排名是多少？是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16407.429, "timestamp": "04:33:27", "text": "好的。哟，他怎么会被判罚点球？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16420.07, "timestamp": "04:33:40", "text": "乔克，一切都好吗？我应该吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16438.07, "timestamp": "04:33:58", "text": "发生了吗？我会等待。我会等乔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16439.99, "timestamp": "04:33:59", "text": "他在聊天中说了些什么，"}]